UID:165071@iso-ne.com
DTSTAMP:20260903T105353Z
DTSTART:20260902T154500Z
SUMMARY:Forward Capacity Market Second Annual Reconfiguration Auction (w/ ARTs) Results Available for Capacity Commitment Period 2027-2028
DESCRIPTION:The Forward Capacity Market Second Annual Reconfiguration Auction and Annual Reconfiguration Transaction for Capacity\n\nCommitment Period 2027-2028 results have been approved. Updated Capacity Supply Obligation positions resulting\n\nfrom the auction approval can be found in the Forward Capacity Tracking System application under Commitment Period\n\n2027-2028. Updated Annual Reconfiguration Transaction status can be found in the Forward Capacity Market\n\nReconfiguration Auction & ARTs application under Commitment Period 2027-2028. Individual MIS reports can be found\n\nin the MIS reports titled SP_ARARESULT. The results summary for this auction can be found here.\nhttps://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=165071
URL:https://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=165071
END:VEVENT
