BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:164404@iso-ne.com
DTSTAMP:20260903T105353Z
DTSTART:20260908T170000Z
DTEND:20260908T190000Z
SUMMARY:Cluster Study Process Participation Forum
LOCATION:Webinar
DESCRIPTION:This forum will focus on participation in the Cluster Request Window (CRW) and Customer Engagement Window (CEW) for projects seeking to participate in the upcoming Cluster Study. It will provide a timeline of the CRW and CEW\, outline all required components for a valid Interconnection Request\, explain the data submission process\, and discuss the purpose and requirements for the Cluster Study Agreement (CSA).\n\nKey Objectives\n\n•  Describing the timeline and milestones associated with the CRW and CEW\n\n•  Identifying all components for a valid Interconnection Request\n\n•  Learning how to submit Cluster Study data during the Cluster Request Window\n\n•  Emphasizing the importance of timely and study-ready data submission\n\n•  Understanding the purpose of the NDA required for the group Scoping Meeting\n\n•  Understanding the purpose and requirements of the CSA\n\nThe session will begin with a walkthrough of these core areas\, followed by a review of submitted questions. Participants will also have the opportunity to ask questions during the forum.\n\nRegister Now!\nContact: Market Training (MkTraining@iso-ne.com)\nhttps://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=164404
URL:https://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=164404
END:VEVENT
