SUMMARY:Columbus Day
DESCRIPTION:ISO New England observes this holiday:\n\n\n	Participant Support and most other departments are not staffed\n	Settlements will not be released and initial settlement metering deadlines will not fall on this day\n	The Credit department is closed\, along with Federal Reserve and BlackRock\n\n\nFor after-hours business emergencies\, contact Participant Support at (877) 226-4814 (pager). See Contact the ISO for other options.\nhttps://www.iso-ne.com/event-details?eventId=161792
